{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Rooted Intensives for Daily Balance</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Short intensive rhythms, daily habits, and outcome-focused frameworks to steady your energy and strengthen routines.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="layout-earthy">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav">
        <a href="/">Hearth</a>
        <a href="/programs.html">Curricula</a>
        <a href="/services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Book a Session</a>
        <a href="/testimonials.html">Reflections</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      <button id="floating-practice" class="floating-practice" aria-label="Try a quick practice">Try a practice</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="hero">
      <div class="pattern"></div>
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Short intensives to rebalance the day</h1>
          <p class="lead">A three-hour-style intensive design for your week — small, repeatable frameworks that produce real rhythm and measurable habits. Outcomes first, practices second.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button class="btn ghost" id="open-practice">Try a quick practice</button>
          </div>
          <ul class="hero-meta">
            <li>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></li>
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
            <li>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-tools">
          <div class="tool card">
            <h3>7‑Day Habit Builder</h3>
            <p>Create a focused week with a printable checklist.</p>
            <form id="habit-form">
              <label>Focus area
                <select id="habit-focus">
                  <option>Morning calm</option>
                  <option>Workday reset</option>
                  <option>Evening unwind</option>
                  <option>Movement boost</option>
                  <option>Hydration habit</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label>Small daily practice
                <input id="habit-action" type="text" value="5 minutes breathing" />
              </label>
              <button class="btn" id="generate-habit">Generate checklist</button>
            </form>
            <div id="habit-output" class="habit-output" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="social-proof wrap">
      <h2>Stories from the lab</h2>
      <div class="proof-grid">
        <blockquote>
          "In three weeks we translated a chaotic schedule into a reliable 20-minute launch ritual. My mornings are steady again."
          <cite>— S., Product Lead</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          "The short intensives gave me a language for habit, not a long program — I could actually stick to it."
          <cite>— M., Entrepreneur</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="benefits wrap" id="benefits">
      <h2>What you gain</h2>
      <ul class="benefit-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Actionable habits</strong>
          <p>Concrete micro-habits built into your existing day so they don’t demand more time.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Outcome-first frames</strong>
          <p>Practices tied directly to measurable outcomes — focus, calm, energy, or recovery.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Portable rituals</strong>
          <p>Portable templates you can use anywhere: office, travel, or home.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="process wrap">
      <h2>The Intensive Way</h2>
      <ol class="process-steps">
        <li><strong>Clarify:</strong> Identify one outcome you want by the end of the week.</li>
        <li><strong>Map:</strong> Choose three micro-actions you can repeat each day.</li>
        <li><strong>Practice:</strong> Try the sequence for seven days and track it.</li>
        <li><strong>Adjust:</strong> Small course-corrections based on what worked.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="faq wrap" id="faq">
      <h2>Questions people ask</h2>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Is this a therapy or medical program?</h3>
        <p>No — these are practical, non-medical habit and routine frameworks focused on wellbeing and daily function.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How long before I notice change?</h3>
        <p>Clients often notice better clarity and steadier days within one to three weeks when they commit to the micro-habits.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta wrap" id="cta">
      <h2>Ready to design a steadier week?</h2>
      <p>Book a focused session to pin down one outcome and a week-long plan you can actually follow.</p>
      <a class="btn primary" href="/book.html">Book an intensive</a>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p>Hands-on frameworks for practical daily wellbeing.</p>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a href="/programs.html">Programs</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Pricing</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <p class="fineprint">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <!-- Guided Practice Modal -->
  <div id="practice-modal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal-panel">
      <button class="modal-close" id="close-practice">×</button>
      <h3 id="practice-title">Quick Practice</h3>
      <div class="practice-controls">
        <label>Mode
          <select id="practice-mode">
            <option value="breathing">Breathing</option>
            <option value="journaling">Journaling</option>
            <option value="intention">Intention setting</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>Duration
          <select id="practice-duration">
            <option value="1">1 min</option>
            <option value="3" selected>3 min</option>
            <option value="5">5 min</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button class="btn" id="start-practice">Start</button>
      </div>

      <div id="practice-stage" class="practice-stage">
        <!-- Dynamic practice UI appears here -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"}
